@model Reflect.Web.Models.ViewModels.Provider.Goals.GoalFormViewModel
@using Reflect.Web.Models.ViewModels.Provider.Goals
<form method="post" class="js-loading-submit" novalidate>
    <input type="hidden" asp-for="Id" />
    <input type="hidden" asp-for="PatientId" />
    <div asp-validation-summary="ModelOnly" class="alert alert-danger"></div>

    <div class="card custom-card">
        <div class="card-header"><div class="card-title">Goal</div></div>
        <div class="card-body">
            @if (!Model.IsEdit)
            {
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <span class="form-label d-block">Start from a common goal</span>
                    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        @foreach (var t in GoalFormViewModel.Templates)
                        {
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary rpd-template-btn js-goal-template"
                                    data-title="@t.Title" data-measure="@t.Measure" data-unit="@t.Unit" data-direction="@t.Direction">
                                <i class="ri-magic-line me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>@t.Title
                            </button>
                        }
                    </div>
                </div>
            }
            <div class="row g-3">
                <div class="col-md-8">
                    <label asp-for="Title" class="form-label"></label>
                    <input asp-for="Title" class="form-control" />
                    <span asp-validation-for="Title" class="text-danger fs-12"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <label asp-for="Status" class="form-label"></label>
                    <select asp-for="Status" class="form-select">
                        <option value="Active">Active</option>
                        <option value="OnHold">On hold</option>
                        <option value="Achieved">Achieved</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
                <div class="col-12">
                    <label asp-for="Description" class="form-label"></label>
                    <textarea asp-for="Description" class="form-control" rows="3" placeholder="What the patient is working toward, in their words if possible."></textarea>
                    <span asp-validation-for="Description" class="text-danger fs-12"></span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h2 class="rpd-form-section-title mt-4">How progress is measured</h2>
            <div class="row g-3">
                <div class="col-md-5">
                    <label asp-for="MeasureName" class="form-label"></label>
                    <input asp-for="MeasureName" class="form-control" placeholder="For example, PHQ-9 score" />
                    <span asp-validation-for="MeasureName" class="text-danger fs-12"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <label asp-for="Unit" class="form-label"></label>
                    <input asp-for="Unit" class="form-control" placeholder="points" />
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <label asp-for="Direction" class="form-label"></label>
                    <select asp-for="Direction" class="form-select">
                        <option value="Decrease">Down (lower is better)</option>
                        <option value="Increase">Up (higher is better)</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <label asp-for="BaselineValue" class="form-label"></label>
                    <input asp-for="BaselineValue" class="form-control" type="number" step="0.1" min="0" />
                    <span asp-validation-for="BaselineValue" class="text-danger fs-12"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <label asp-for="CurrentValue" class="form-label"></label>
                    <input asp-for="CurrentValue" class="form-control" type="number" step="0.1" min="0" />
                    <span asp-validation-for="CurrentValue" class="text-danger fs-12"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <label asp-for="TargetValue" class="form-label"></label>
                    <input asp-for="TargetValue" class="form-control" type="number" step="0.1" min="0" />
                    <span asp-validation-for="TargetValue" class="text-danger fs-12"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-6">
                    <label asp-for="StartDate" class="form-label"></label>
                    <input asp-for="StartDate" class="form-control js-date" type="text" value="@Model.StartDate?.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd", System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)" />
                    <span asp-validation-for="StartDate" class="text-danger fs-12"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-6">
                    <label asp-for="TargetDate" class="form-label"></label>
                    <input asp-for="TargetDate" class="form-control js-date" type="text" value="@Model.TargetDate?.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd", System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)" />
                    <span asp-validation-for="TargetDate" class="text-danger fs-12"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 justify-content-end page-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" href="@Url.Action("Details", "Patients", new { id = Model.PatientId, tab = "goals" })">Cancel</a>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="ri-save-line me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>@(Model.IsEdit ? "Save changes" : "Add goal")</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</form>
